#
# Keepsake, backups with versions. How many backups a prune removes is
# worked out in Sutra and in KRON, and the owner is asked to confirm only
# when they agree; what a prune may keep (never none) is Eve.
zxapp 1
id     keepsake
name   Keepsake
version 1.0.0
slot   10
layer  L1
icon   icons/l1/010-keepsake.svg
budget 233
needs  backup
needs  fs.read
needs  ai.ask
model  apps/keepsake_model.c

provides removed num snapshots keep
logic    sutra removed apps/blocks/keepsake/removed.sutra
logic    kron  removed apps/blocks/keepsake/removed.kron

provides keep_ok truth keep
logic    eve keep_ok apps/blocks/keepsake/keep.eve
